nsight with Haslinda Amin) 进行了对话。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;在有争议的克什米尔地区，巴基斯坦管辖的部分地区的选民&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/cuLDkfCb-pmo7NcCGBrwEk-AhyXYEm2UJfq9cKCdlzZAH7KdE4-XISaFg-BZDjy0apOh95XKucyA8OKHFSp7Nq47bNOn0Ul45u-v7_Fn_32s9J_SgDXw6TkNE2Aw48wiRmea9yXqV1pnkZrhejYHI2eA7aUwHS8Oz5iHuInF-9tQbCiVuET04yphwWe4uQdoLwaFT5c3r5zEVfcLjbS6pOLAbWsdCl_5rKdFQdTehcdFEuygg4NHwrvTlY453yKx2Md7VUwIVwvYrBg_q0hgQShDbcsVvG_FhcfQtZN6hmbOJ28gTn6Qt5JyV6KMAL_Epj7z6Z0bt01oYeSEuzGRwXvOnXNXps7KOzJiwdxzm3gBIhFJ0TB1cCWycDPQ7-2i7tZebfOkA5-idJm4VrIxlG-FvIN3nIWf30GEcah4eoRCDUfgAPHDfzFaOaDhb0_1UCBfQGe2tKcbHfPbOc55X1qk3DloMrTXlc13023R4hV6dLg1uxI1K5zy83zw-64_bGrUTtQR72bn3j-AVeiaf8dpxrdj7PxxpzcJCd33hY3zuu_k3caGdHX3CHEofrc/8o-XBzlftFxG5iCJ3rSCC8uK4TtEGm8H/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="关于巴控克什米尔选举需要了解什么"&gt;前往投票站&lt;/a&gt;选举该地区立法会议的成员，然后立法会议将选出一名总理来组建当地政府。虽然这次投票不会改变长达数十年的克什米尔领土争端——印度和巴基斯坦都声称对克什米尔拥有主权——但&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;两国都将密切关注，因为它们试图加强在该领土上的相互竞争的叙述。&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;据官方媒体报道，&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;朝鲜领导人金正恩的妹妹&lt;/strong&gt;谴责了无核化的呼吁，称该国的核武器是其“ &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/SbuE1waqjv02uBcZUyiOhRwWoqtmmKVVI1JwvdGLIr53OgErg2eE_8QdG7H8zxGYvTjKfuY8V2Ym5uKTTiVzIBHutCD1JsSUtRv96kwFXPHTwhGqzzFCgxsiy6iYS47ah2YE_ki_Grtr7k4wTVlN4hfh3Lge74ih2MYvfL4D2MhAOr84OX671MU6jhwWmdO6as9G7nJBECUCON1bHY5-Pv8m_kUAvTAwUllLM9dKr6QMBBAwqReURYIc6qeOci33yOsty79N_BdcSprjSqYSIcL_h1e7ukpCKlveInYs90Wqz7_VdZ0itJ3cmut0YEVYY0nmeJfaduTxhvTgXS8Fw6inGenYIDyRPrb61b0oidn4D3dL-M9uFi_JEmf_N3YG7jEG9t3ic3yfadYwdTqECNRnFijNkCg8LBhwquFiUz0ph_S7kV3zaeW9irEuHKs7iONr8Ut-bWJVNe4-4xUiHXc_nawepkZq8mlKD_eE_xF3TD2_HHd3pnV_Xk7QPwo_Q-y4KRrsUnisTYTOOxmE1pr85G1nWgR5XcRTTweTu6hP/3wryabWWSBAoEGZO_